{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026rdpoTVqExV1793253853.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>交代宏福苑火災獨立委員會報告的記者會在政府總部演講廳舉行，行政長官李家超會率相關官員出席。現場所見，安排了八個座位，即除了特首外，會有另外七位官員出席。</p><p></p><p>除了披露報告內容，預料亦會交代一系列改革措施。不過由於大火亦涉及刑事成分，部分涉案人士已被起訴，報告亦未必可以全面公開，以免影響司法程序。</p><p></p><p>另外，政府稍後亦會將報告放上網，供公眾閱覽。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:02:23.546190+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T11:58:17.568374+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:59:05.844801+00:00","content_hash":"fc47434c2d179f189a540fc42bedcebe8f43533fa0bc2915a404083d611fbbe5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:02:23.546190+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}